[{"comment_id": "7693505737206022963", "create_time": 1791283895, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "九叶重楼一生难遇，冬至蝉蛹本就无迹，隔年落雪留不住半分。世间本就没有忘情汤，偏要寻这些根本得不到的东西入煎，不是为了真的熬出一碗忘却的药。\n重楼求而不得，如同我求不得你；冬至没有蝉蛹，就像我们没有往后；隔年雪转瞬消融，恰似留不住的旧时光。借世间不存在的物，熬一碗不存在的汤，明知万事皆不可得，却还妄想把满腔执念，煮成一场放下。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "351", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAVO3DB_SgHGbXaCSUp6V64jaiReOiE5cXLa61cMMz3BtO3nPdLp-rmDXWMMeyRwsY", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAVO3DB_SgHGbXaCSUp6V64jaiReOiE5cXLa61cMMz3BtO3nPdLp-rmDXWMMeyRwsY", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "ws243928980", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "暮雪知意", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oQcj9Ani0IyjaA4AZqAWu2xAEQBm7IP9ABPiv.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "9", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7694018863629550377", "create_time": 1791403378, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "忘情牛肉面之所以能“忘情” 不过是情绪的转移罢了 跋山涉水、攀登绝巅只为取其材 在这段旅途中你的疲惫和旅途中所见到的风景和美好事物会冲淡你对那个人的思念 正可谓“且将新火试新茶”。所以脱离执念的唯一解是不断尝试与接触新事物", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "182", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAw0tR_ENHSYQtO8yrn0gd3Y8-o-L89ph8nkF2DdhsK6un5cIsxuwTThEQI0YnMxF_", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAw0tR_ENHSYQtO8yrn0gd3Y8-o-L89ph8nkF2DdhsK6un5cIsxuwTThEQI0YnMxF_", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "2231157873", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Gríezman！", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_6b6c02dad32c7a6b45069dbdb0a13dd7.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693511960647140115", "create_time": 1791285343, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "我问大夫，什么药可解相思之苦?\n他说：九叶重楼二两，冬至蝉蛹一钱，煎入隔年雪，可医世人相思疾苦。\n我又问：可重楼七叶一枝花，冬至何来蝉蛹，雪又怎能隔年，相思又怎能可解!\n大夫说：殊不知，夏枯即为九重楼，掘地三尺寒蝉现、除夕子时雪，落地已隔年，过了离别时，相思亦可解!", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "113", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAieYRQHMpLRY6PwcID12MiLaLu6yz7VcrTlMAtjsXryRdlKYIAqh_OIEs9mxOIU_R", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAieYRQHMpLRY6PwcID12MiLaLu6yz7VcrTlMAtjsXryRdlKYIAqh_OIEs9mxOIU_R", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "52840033533", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "快乐", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/aweme_default_avatar.png.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693568886302425898", "create_time": 1791298597, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "重楼非九叶，寒蝉不待冬，隔年无旧雪，相思本无药。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "134", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAPQcrVawJGZak3MEhJp21B4KSSDwpekw1-4bgzWU8W3YRcUMrRQwhyVnq8YdB5TLy", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAPQcrVawJGZak3MEhJp21B4KSSDwpekw1-4bgzWU8W3YRcUMrRQwhyVnq8YdB5TLy", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "71687228837", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "鹏飞粮油", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_osspEaiNALDhYgnOAABAIFJxeS0goCBAA1iTfc.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "5", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693563518331798310", "create_time": 1791297347, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "所谓忘情面，所谓忘情，不过是在寻找九叶重楼、冬至蝉蛹，隔年雪的过程中，在寻找和等待的时间里释怀、淡忘过去的情爱，和过去的自己和解罢了。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "834", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAE9xrTp27Ve3HrlEyYJ94t7I93BUa8usha6jsCuX3aQ8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAE9xrTp27Ve3HrlEyYJ94t7I93BUa8usha6jsCuX3aQ8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1044658811", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "崩了真君", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_b7ab864e834f2bf0b0323db7e507397d.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "9", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693565344783631153", "create_time": 1791297772, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "其实真正让你忘情的不是这一碗面，而是你要做这碗面需要寻找的这些材料，寻找这些材料的途中，你上山下海，经历了许多更加丰富的人和事，得到收获其中的喜悦，让你看到了这个世界上除了感情爱情之外，很多很多的其他东西，领悟到了生命的神奇与美好，不在执着于那点小伤小情", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "354", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAM6CvCui0W3iv3O-6OGoTMqI92ffasYN9B5axB9VKLff1odvFQNyc2pp9f38UfSdc", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAM6CvCui0W3iv3O-6OGoTMqI92ffasYN9B5axB9VKLff1odvFQNyc2pp9f38UfSdc", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "87083099862", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Daisy", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oMfT43uAEAEiAdw3zMB1e1IlXEAEOgeCEiIACx.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "8", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693505016006509361", "create_time": 1791283725, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "九叶重楼二两，冬至蝉蛹一钱，煎入隔年雪可解世人相思疾苦。可是重楼七叶一枝花，冬至何来蝉蛹，雪又怎能隔年？原是相思无解。 \n殊不知，夏枯即为九重楼，掘地三尺寒蝉现，除夕子时雪，落地已隔年。过了离别时，相思亦可解。 \n可奈何，夏枯辛苦深寒，寒蝉体小声微，面拂寒夜风？隔年雪冻人。相思虽可解，但寒苦卑弥已入喉，肠以断，泪难收。回首白头，相思亦无解。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "77", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAMULHk3p4MSUtherAQDZUqqpNkvnRrqc0S8PCo2AQz5OODnKchIM7o92cXvlwiAeG", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAMULHk3p4MSUtherAQDZUqqpNkvnRrqc0S8PCo2AQz5OODnKchIM7o92cXvlwiAeG", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "59476801033", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "红尘剑仙", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/douyin-user-image-file_7649e7a735c62e6f2d933f630c0c864b.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7698759366845350719", "create_time": 1792507100, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "忘情汤的每一位料，只是为了让你知难而退，如果你真的找到所有的，吃下那一刻说明你也该释怀了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "27", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAW9t6gZuKPetTTT99VIJxBmgezOqCLHtnqiBREqtCf9s", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAW9t6gZuKPetTTT99VIJxBmgezOqCLHtnqiBREqtCf9s", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "CSbQGLZ", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "DuskLore", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oEWfFOJDQAAqIDaDISA8fCAUA2eySIbl6AHneD.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693796827258471205", "create_time": 1791351668, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "南翔老师，你做的面给我看饿了", "is_author_digged": true, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "58776", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAXrN-U-HqemT2hqMvrr1TZRCOflVknHrO2ub9p-YYQwKnhCh1lDNKmgkmucVjt26W", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAXrN-U-HqemT2hqMvrr1TZRCOflVknHrO2ub9p-YYQwKnhCh1lDNKmgkmucVjt26W", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "MJT666888", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "马健涛的工作室", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_owfCAAFE9erfE6FUPwApcQAoIALoc4DDMzWEFE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "357", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693865978749535011", "create_time": 1791367770, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "说白了  就是增加难度  隔年的雪  七叶重楼  蝉  集齐这么多东西  时间跨度  距离跨度  精力消耗  再难忘的也该忘了   如果还是不能忘  那就说明忘情的难度不亚于集齐这一碗面  也是人的美好愿望罢了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "13", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAYdIT8ZcqbwK7jjtVArkT2nZOvtyRuAHws3FAtver6QI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAYdIT8ZcqbwK7jjtVArkT2nZOvtyRuAHws3FAtver6QI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "kekexunxun76", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "🌻舒畅🌵", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oED5AEfAoIyEuF0ASC5fAdBiCqAbC9gKSqEsAA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693498829328745274", "create_time": 1791282285, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "前些天在药房看到一味药叫徐长卿。后来才知道。景天，雪见，飞蓬，重楼都是中药的名字，并且徐长卿和重楼都可解蛇毒。据说徐长卿的药效更好，所以徐长卿可以为了“道”放弃紫萱，而重楼。可以为了紫萱把心给他，紫萱，又叫忘忧草。九叶重楼二两，冬至蚕蛹一钱，间入隔年雪。可医世人相思疾苦，可重楼七叶一枝花，冬至何来蚕蛹，雪又怎能隔年？原是相思无解。[躺平]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "21", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAyfwSSR9USQzLkzNQHFIkpaMAkuHCUXHp-fSZssOIOh0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAyfwSSR9USQzLkzNQHFIkpaMAkuHCUXHp-fSZssOIOh0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "DJ1011", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "ℳ·一安🦄", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_0d191c4d36d3bc434d0efe820d7a9ad0.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693792665188434737", "create_time": 1791350699, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "感觉可能是因为做这碗面需要费的功夫之间能让人忘记那些感情了。但是南翔不是一般人，所以他并没有，他天天都这么忙活[憨笑]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "6", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwAXoxy-TH0AhPGb-j9x62ba6MqHe3KB5SvOn54eU0YwtfzZ2omaH7Mwh6ok18YYu", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwAXoxy-TH0AhPGb-j9x62ba6MqHe3KB5SvOn54eU0YwtfzZ2omaH7Mwh6ok18YYu", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "39287619473", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "对岸", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oIPFMACpEw9oDoABgfzQwIKfqgAqFDEn8AEwAE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7694095319008723752", "create_time": 1791421167, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "我记得早些年有个文案:九叶重楼二两 冬至蚕蛹一钱 煎入隔年雪 可解相思之苦", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "20", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAArgDt8oV8irOujrP5Jlm8eKPtoG6-Wyu2Ta-wm8t34DBBL7MVxzOT5t0d8H7oGwVj", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAArgDt8oV8irOujrP5Jlm8eKPtoG6-Wyu2Ta-wm8t34DBBL7MVxzOT5t0d8H7oGwVj", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Y_06_08_H", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "纥諳焓", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oMiCXAT1CAl0AtfAi0tPAe4CCxRPIOKAARUgEB.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693600528568582938", "create_time": 1791305970, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "重楼七叶一枝花，冬至何来蛹？怎能采取隔年雪，相思怎可解！\n后来方知，夏枯即为九重楼，挖地三尺寒蝉现，除夕子时雪，落地已隔年！原来过了离别时，相思亦可解！\n可，若非相思入骨，又何以药来解？此药不比相思苦，怎能解得相思毒呢！世人总是一叶障目，失去是互相的，而思念却是用来困住自己的。直到千帆过尽，才恍然大悟，夏枯难得九重叶，三尺蝉非寒蝉，唯有落雪似可觅，可三味缺其二，原来相思本无解…", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "70", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAADssd2FnMWctmBYzq-SZ1joFqPrDxnTQNx-hDoS91DxU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAADssd2FnMWctmBYzq-SZ1joFqPrDxnTQNx-hDoS91DxU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "339802442", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "瓜子的猫鱼龟", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_494817e10a8ee190f4fd20943eb5ce15.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7695748713629827859", "create_time": 1791806127, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "忘情牛肉面，是在找材料过程中，野外寻找九叶重楼时看到山河的壮阔，寻找冬至蝉时感受到生命的流转，是隔年雪摸到的时间的流逝。看透山河壮阔，感受生命流转，抚摸时间流逝，还忘不掉，就该死了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "18", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAARsOKQdSQokDVlbu1GKZ13JbOHJyManITQsSTaalgHEQ", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAARsOKQdSQokDVlbu1GKZ13JbOHJyManITQsSTaalgHEQ", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "515555.", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "俩眼一睁就开练💪", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oQfeEAUnqwiGBAr3vkCVIhBKgAikA1A5OXBCAi.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7695372939969119035", "create_time": 1791718635, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "为了食材跑遍中国几万公里。让我想起，2003年西藏的藏红花，当年老板让我从海南出发3000公里，去西藏雪山，买这个给他吃，当时，卖16000一斤[捂脸]，一次买30斤回来，吃一年[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "7", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAUTmAp0CyTrzQRfhU-O9O1PgJXOViRpzJSvv51bW_Bb8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAUTmAp0CyTrzQRfhU-O9O1PgJXOViRpzJSvv51bW_Bb8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1134247743", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小时候", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/9875000b589466121055.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7695713876898480934", "create_time": 1791798017, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "知道为啥能忘情吗？因为古代凑齐食材太难，需要特别多年，并且要专注努力，用时间和转移注意力来冲淡感情。但真有情又怎能忘记呢，凑齐食材过程之中又何尝不是对情深的表达呢？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "19", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA8nUijH-Six2ZkITMzXblAK6KFYZ_2MM3wedTPxhGwDg", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA8nUijH-Six2ZkITMzXblAK6KFYZ_2MM3wedTPxhGwDg", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1512206697", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "卢，自贡水电运营中心", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_70ddf5e92de645b98d53df3139050f44.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693834085069046577", "create_time": 1791360345, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "我冰箱里有隔年雪", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "921", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAh5jLNtQ-fHNZfpehNIYIs73tTzqp-nAo3ByKgPZpWrE", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAh5jLNtQ-fHNZfpehNIYIs73tTzqp-nAo3ByKgPZpWrE", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1171762146", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "今天不要赖床了", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oMAApzEIEEwpcYWfTAFoZSBmwBAeZAA2DCQ9Az.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "20", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693785919862145830", "create_time": 1791349129, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "世人皆传，九叶重楼二两，冬至蝉蛹一钱，煎入隔年雪，可医世间相思苦。 我觅尽万水千山，山陵断，天地合，仍未寻见。 亦有世人传，重楼不过七叶，冬至本无蝉蛹，雪又岂能隔年？相思本就无解。 但我知，九叶重楼即夏枯，掘地三尺寒蝉现，除夕子时雪，落地已隔年！过了离别时，相思亦可解！我更知，相思并非无解，而不愿解。 无，不过卿也。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "37", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAKHLfVFQ46TqeGgvMSN-3Zvn-N4vQHL-3708tDQgzLYxHCnSUbxxHgfUMsf-cr4Ry", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAKHLfVFQ46TqeGgvMSN-3Zvn-N4vQHL-3708tDQgzLYxHCnSUbxxHgfUMsf-cr4Ry", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "41219737613", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "灰太狼", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_417392e395f44ef985e59a6234a57399.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419810639}, {"comment_id": "7693920600042505010", "create_time": 1791380489, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7693441235851234598", "content": "在一本老书上看过，所谓的忘情汤，就是时间。现代搜集这些材料都要费点劲，别提古代那个山高水长，只能靠双腿或者骑行的时代了。所谓忘情汤的本质，就是让人在漫长的时间里，遗忘和释怀", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "33", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAApP8sK0-1WSD-RriJgC_64OfWH4mgzv_RwjuseKGdL8bih5sqUSkrY9QjPfdDwA-n", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAApP8sK0-1WSD-RriJgC_64OfWH4mgzv_RwjuseKGdL8bih5sqUSkrY9QjPfdDwA-n", "short_user_id": "", "use